            "Check and save": [
                "Ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 l\u01b0u"
            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 danh s\u00e1ch g\u1eedi th\u01b0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n; sau \u0111\u00f3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu n\u00e0o c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec1n v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t trong c\u00e1c danh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n (c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ee7a kh\u1ed1i bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu \u2192 Sau khi g\u1eedi). C\u00e1c kh\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m tra v\u1edbi d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef m\u00e3 h\u00f3a tr\u00ean trang web n\u00e0y v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u1ea1i."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "G\u1eedi c\u00e1c l\u1ea7n g\u1eedi bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o n\u00fat \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n m\u00e3. \u0110\u1ec3 tr\u1ed1ng ID \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f3. C\u00e1c n\u00fat c\u00f3 tr\u01b0\u1eddng \"S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i\" trong b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n N\u00e2ng cao c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang. Khi bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef cookie \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1eadt, s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 g\u00ec t\u1ea3i cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi kh\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "M\u00e3 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng Google Analytics 4"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "ID v\u00f9ng ch\u1ee9a Google Tag Manager"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "ID Meta Pixel (s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Meta)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "T\u1ea3i c\u00e1c th\u1ebb n\u00e0y tr\u00ean trang web c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "T\u1eaft n\u1ebfu giao di\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed9t plugin kh\u00e1c \u0111\u00e3 th\u00eam ch\u00fang; c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u1eabn s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "T\u00ean s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n cho c\u00e1c l\u1ea7n g\u1eedi bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 b\u1eadt l\u00ean do b\u1ea1n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c kh\u1ed1i. C\u00e1c n\u00fat c\u1ee7a n\u00f3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u1edbi #consent-accept, #consent-reject v\u00e0 #consent-save (k\u00e8m c\u00e1c h\u1ed9p ki\u1ec3m c\u00f3 t\u00ean analytics v\u00e0 marketing cho \"save\"); m\u1ed9t li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u1edbi #consent-open \u1edf b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111\u00e2u s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u1ea1i bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef n\u00e0y. Cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi kh\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd, c\u00e1c th\u1ebb theo d\u00f5i s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea3i, Google Consent Mode v\u1eabn \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \"denied\", v\u00e0 c\u00e1c t\u1eadp l\u1ec7nh b\u1ea1n li\u1ec7t k\u00ea s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c b\u1ecb t\u1eaft."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "T\u1ea1o bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef l\u00e0m s\u1eb5n"
            ],
            "Show a cookie banner": [
                "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef cookie"
            ],
            "Banner": [
                "Bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef"
            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "Ch\u1ecdn c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 b\u1eadt l\u00ean\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (b\u1ea3n nh\u00e1p)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "Ghi nh\u1edb l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trong (ng\u00e0y)"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "B\u00ean ngo\u00e0i Li\u00ean minh Ch\u00e2u \u00c2u, EEA v\u00e0 V\u01b0\u01a1ng qu\u1ed1c Anh: t\u1ea3i t\u00ednh n\u0103ng theo d\u00f5i cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi kh\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "T\u1eaft: m\u1ecdi kh\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u1ec1u ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd tr\u01b0\u1edbc (quy t\u1eafc nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t nh\u1ea5t v\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh). B\u1eadt: ch\u1ec9 khi m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef ho\u1eb7c CDN c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u00e1o c\u00e1o qu\u1ed1c gia c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch truy c\u1eadp (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 CF-IPCountry c\u1ee7a Cloudflare) v\u00e0 qu\u1ed1c gia \u0111\u00f3 n\u1eb1m ngo\u00e0i EU, EEA, V\u01b0\u01a1ng qu\u1ed1c Anh v\u00e0 Th\u1ee5y S\u0129. Bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t qu\u1ed1c gia kh\u00f4ng x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem nh\u01b0 n\u1eb1m trong EU."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "C\u00e1c t\u1eadp l\u1ec7nh kh\u00e1c c\u1ea7n gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd (handle:analytics ho\u1eb7c handle:marketing, ph\u00e2n t\u00e1ch b\u1eb1ng d\u1ea5u ph\u1ea9y)"
            ],
            "Popups, slide-ins and bars": [
                "C\u1eeda s\u1ed5 b\u1eadt l\u00ean, thanh tr\u01b0\u1ee3t v\u00e0 thanh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5"
            ],
            "A\/B test results": [
                "K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m A\/B"
            ],
            "Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A\/B tests and the cookie banner": [
                "H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn: bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu, c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 b\u1eadt l\u00ean, chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, theo d\u00f5i, th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m A\/B v\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u ng\u1eef cookie"
            ],
